Prisma STT is failing to convert recorded speech into text. Diagnose and fix the root cause.

* Inspect microphone recording, audio format, MIME type and upload process.
* Verify the Gnani API endpoint, authentication, request parameters and response parsing against official documentation.
* Verify `GNANI_API_KEY` is correctly loaded from `.env.local`.
* Inspect actual backend errors and API responses.
* Fix the issue without rebuilding the application.
* Preserve existing UI and microphone functionality.
* Never use mock transcripts or another STT provider.
* Add proper error handling.

**Test:** Record real Marathi, Hindi and Hinglish speech and verify that Prisma returns the actual transcription in the chat.

Do not declare completion until real speech-to-text conversion works. Briefly report the root cause and fix.

